  91: **Theorem A (design (a‴_k; μ)) [claimed; assembled from the sources].** Fix (d, k, μ, η₀) as in §1 with θ < 1.
  92: There is a randomized Las Vegas algorithm that, on input any integer N ≥ 2, outputs the complete prime
  93: factorisation of N, and whose expected running time is at most
