 396: **Theorem LD\* [label omitted].**
 397: - **Hypotheses.** §1 and §2, with S² = (log N)^{C₃}/(ρ_rρ_F) as in pcest Theorem 4.3, and N_ℓ(A) the filtered
 398:   count under the moment law 𝒜‴.
 399: - **Conclusion.** E[N(N−1)] ≤ (log N)^{O(1)}·S⁴ρ_r²ρ_F².
