 433:       E[N(N−1)] ≤ (C_dC_W/(H²V₋^{2d−4}))·E_{ℓ,g} Σ_{P≠P′} Y_PY_{P′}·𝔔(tℓq)/φ(t).   (5.1)
 434:   - No joint law of (r₀(P), r₀(P′)) under the shared w is needed.
