 448: - **Step 6 (partners).** For fixed P and q, at most 12 points P′ ∈ 𝒫_ℓ have det(P, P′) = ±ℓq. They lie on two
 449:   lines parallel to P; on each, consecutive integer points differ by P, with |P| ≥ V/2, inside a segment
 450:   of length ≤ 2√2V.
 451: - **Step 7 (assembly).**
 452:   - Bound all ℓ-dependent geometric factors by their envelopes. These are #𝒫_ℓ ≤ CV_max²/log V₋,
 453:     |𝒢| ≥ cM², U and V^{−(2d−4)} ≤ V₋^{−(2d−4)}; V_max/V₋ ≤ 2. Then apply (4.1):
 454:       E[N(N−1)] ≤ C·(H²V₋^{2d−4})^{−1}M^{−2}·V_max²·(M/V₋)ρ_r·Σ_{q≤2S²} τ(q)(log N)^{O(1)}Ψ(X′₊)Ψ(X*)²/(Yq(MV₋)²).
