  86:   constant of Drappeau's Lemme 5 (§2, D).
  87: 
  88: **Lemma 8.5′.** In regime (R), let Y, Q be reals with y^K ≤ Y and x^λ·Y ≤ Q ≤ x^{1/2−λ}. Put
  89: - J := {ℓ prime : Y < ℓ ≤ 2Y};
  90: - 𝒯_Q := {t = ℓs ∈ (Q/2, Q] : ℓ ∈ J, P⁺(s) ≤ y};
