The restart calculation checks out: fresh runs give a rapidly decreasing tail using only \(\mathbb E[T_j]\). It does not require \(\mathbb E[T_j\log T_j]\). The literature checks also distinguish model-specific smoothness barriers from general lower bounds for factoring; the statement on Lenstra–Pomerance p. 509 concerns their own algorithm and its choice of smoothness bound.
